		"description": "<p>You draw your hand along your blade before lashing out, limning it in hellish flame. As a bonus action, you coat your weapon in green flame, causing your next successful attack before the end of your next turn to strike two targets within reach. The first target takes damage normally. The second target takes half the damage dealt to the first target as necrotic damage. If the second target is cursed, they instead take full damage.</p>",
